sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant K8s as Kubernetes
    participant Pod1 as ProximaDB Pod (AZ-1)
    participant Pod2 as ProximaDB Pod (AZ-2)
    participant S3 as S3/Blob/GCS
    participant S3R as Cross-Region Storage
    
    Note over Client,S3R: Normal Operation - Stateless Deployment
    
    Client->>K8s: Vector Search Request
    K8s->>Pod1: Route to Active Pod
    Pod1->>S3: Read Metadata/Data
    S3-->>Pod1: Return Data
    Pod1-->>Client: Search Results
    
    Note over Pod1,S3: Continuous Replication
    S3->>S3R: Async Replication (continuous)
    
    Note over Client,S3R: Failure Scenario - AZ-1 Goes Down
    
    Client->>K8s: Vector Search Request
    Note over Pod1: ❌ AZ-1 Failure
    K8s->>Pod2: Instant Failover (<1s)
    Pod2->>S3: Read Same Data
    S3-->>Pod2: Return Data
    Pod2-->>Client: Search Results
    
    Note over Client,S3R: Region Failure - Disaster Recovery
    
    Note over S3: ❌ Primary Region Down
    K8s->>Pod2: Deploy in DR Region
    Pod2->>S3R: Read from Replica
    S3R-->>Pod2: Return Data (15-min old)
    Pod2-->>Client: Search Results
    
    Note over Client,S3R: Cost Savings Achieved
    
    rect rgb(144, 238, 144)
        Note over K8s,S3: No API Gateway: -$50K/year
        Note over K8s,S3: No Load Balancer: -$20K/year  
        Note over K8s,S3: Single Instance: -$100K/year
        Note over K8s,S3: No Custom HA: -$40K/year
        Note over K8s,S3: Total Saved: $210K/year
    end
    
    Note over Client,S3R: Performance Metrics
    
    rect rgb(135, 206, 235)
        Note over Pod1,Pod2: RTO: <1 minute (AZ failover)
        Note over Pod1,Pod2: RTO: 15 minutes (Region failover)
        Note over S3,S3R: RPO: 0 (continuous replication)
        Note over Client,K8s: Availability: 99.99%
        Note over Pod1,S3: Latency: 0.9ms (gRPC)
    end